<li>Ackermann gives <span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0715em;">K</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">375.8</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">1190</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">799.6</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">−</span><span class="mord">2320</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>. A 10 m move peaks at about 10° of sway and is quiet (under 0.01°) after 15 s.</li>
